Optional dependencies:

* `gnutls-32bit` 32-bit runtime for Battle.net (needs multilib)
* `freetype-32bit` 32-bit runtime for Battle.net (needs multilib)
* `vulkan-loader-32bit` 32-bit runtime for Battle.net (needs multilib)
* `MangoHud` the in-game overlay Lightforge can enable per game
* `wine-32bit` pulls in all 32-bit libraries Proton needs (needs multilib)
